        "official_en_sha256": "a0c46679b7b77615e5b237e1a78002476a6f7478624bf67dac629a2eee050765"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……軽々しく言ってくれるな。\r\nわかったよ。\r\n何があっても知らないからな！",
        "official_en": "Well forgive me for not leaping at the chance to fly into a volcano, just because you’re feeling “a little curious.” Fine, have it your way—but whatever happens is on you!",
        "real_en": "Don't say that so casually... Fine. But don't blame me if something happens!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
