        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Summon630_Ifrit_02:Summon630_Ifrit_02_001:32b10e83",
        "jp_sha256": "1c0015175fe4606946b1bdb09fae19a975416f40219b684954860d6608329ecd",
        "official_en_sha256": "b3a318491761e9415a87687608c74db44b2aeba3a34a8d86e208c7cf783a0ab6"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "おい、レイン。\r\n本気で火口に入るのか？\r\n中に何があっても知らんぞ？",
        "official_en": "Are you serious, Rain? You’re <text style=\"italic\">actually</> asking us to fly into a volcano?",
        "real_en": "Hey, Rain. Are you seriously going into that crater? Don't blame me for whatever might be in there."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
